      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Pulse 74 and regular, blood pressure 124 over 78, temperature 36.6, oxygen 99 percent, breathing 14 a minute, and you weigh 66 kilos.",
