    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Weighing it all up, the most likely cause is the caffeine, especially the tea late into the evening. I'd say caffeine-related palpitations.",
